yap&#305;lmas&#305; planlanan jeotermal enerji santraline,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
42.55pt'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Kocaeli ilinde
bulunan jeotermal enerji bölgelerine,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
