mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>4 Ekim 2022 Sal&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:6.0cm;text-align:center;
text-indent:-6.0cm;mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:1.6pt'>B&#304;R&#304;NC&#304; OTURUM<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;mso-pagination:none;
mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;
