<p class=3LMZA style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>  </span>Mahmut
Celadet Gaydal&#305;<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                       </span>Nuran
&#304;mir<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                         </span>Mehmet
Ru&#351;tu Tiryaki<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3LMZA style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>               </span>Bitlis<span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                       </span>&#350;&#305;rnak<span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                      </span>Batman<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
